# Local datasheet library: PDFs in datasheets/ are the reader's own
# downloaded copies for bench reference and are NOT committed to this
# repo (they are the manufacturers' documents; the book links to the
# official sources instead — see datasheets/manifest.md).
# The folder's README.md and manifest.md are committed.
datasheets/*.pdf

# VitePress build artefacts: the site is built by the GitHub Action on
# merge to main; nothing generated is committed.
node_modules/
.vitepress/dist/
.vitepress/cache/
